url: "https://eduexpressint.com/press"
abstract: >-
  Open, CC BY 4.0 dataset of 159 verified active universities
  (150 in China across 61 cities and 9 in Malaysia),
  898 degree and language programs, 888 itemized non-tuition fee rows,
  276 scholarship tracks, and a 12-destination Bangladesh study abroad market
  comparison matrix covering Bangladesh Bank AD Student File remittance rules, CSC/CSCA criteria,
  EMGS Malaysia costs, and explicit single-year CNY tuition quartiles.
keywords:
